Commands were read-only and outputs were redacted:

```bash
glab auth status --hostname gitlab.wildberries.ru
GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0 git ls-remote --exit-code \
  https://gitlab.wildberries.ru/portals/agentic-infra/cli/sentry-cli.git \
  109af705e0025cc9e34f2a483e9a41ab722cdc64
```

- `glab auth status`: exit 0. A masked token is available from the configured keyring-backed profile; API transport is HTTPS and Git transport is configured as SSH.
- `git ls-remote`: exit 128 after SSH authentication failed with exit 255. No refs were accepted as evidence and no clone occurred.
- Follow-up: `BUG-260805-107dxl — provision-private-git-transport-for-schema7-runner` requires a clean-root, non-interactive Git read on both hosts without weakening global Git or exposing secret material.

